Package: BayesMVP
Type: Package
Title: BayesMVP: This is a "frozen" version of BayesMVP (https://github.com/CerulloE1996/BayesMVP) used for a simulation study.
Version: 0.1
Date: 2024-05-18
Author: Enzo Cerullo
Maintainer: Enzo Cerullo <enzo.cerullo@bath.edu>
Description: This is a "frozen" version of BayesMVP (https://github.com/CerulloE1996/BayesMVP) used for a simulation study comparing the latent class multivariate probit model (LC-MVP) to the latent class latent trait model (LC-LT) for the analysis of test accuracy data without a perfect gold standard/reference test.
